--- compress — compression abstractions for the handl runtime.
---
--- This is a trait-abstraction library: the Compressor, Decompressor, and
--- Codec traits live in Rust (plugin-lib-compress) and are implemented by
--- concrete compression crates (gzip). There are no callable handl ops
--- here; the .hnl file exists to declare the library's capability surface
--- for the plugin system.
